38118>>>        Else Begin
38119>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38120>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38121>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38122>>>        End
38122>>>>
38122>>>    End_Procedure
